      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Account for the shroud:&nbsp;</li>\n<li>A tunic: 19 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds. A robe of Damietta (linen)</li>\n<li>and a robe of green silk: 2\u2154 and &frac14; dinars.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>A scarf: 10&frac12;&nbsp;q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds. Trousers:</li>\n<li>9 dirhems. A turban:&nbsp;30 dirhems</li>\n<li>A cloak:&nbsp;1 dinar. The coffin: 1&frac12; dinars.</li>\n<li>Trestles: 9&frac12; dinars. Agarwood, camphor, and rosewater: 2. The</li>\n<li>sawyer: &frac12;. The tailor: 3 (dirhams). The journey through the desert: 3&frac12;.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Judges and cantors: 24. Washer (of the body): 7. Someone to carry</li>\n<li>the trestles: 1&frac12;. Pallbearers: 10. Gravedigger: 15.</li>\n<li>Remaining in the hand of his wife: 5. Builders: 12. Watchman: 1.</li>\n<li>Someone to backfill (the grave): 1. Remainder: 2&frac12;.&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
